\par        }{\f0\cf0\highlight7\ulc0\insrsid3696992\charrsid2952169 \u9658\'3f These are organizations of independent firms, producing similar products, that work together to raise prices and restrict output.}{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid3696992\charrsid11669250 

